            <ArticleTitle>Impairment and disability rating in low back pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>719-40, viii</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Many publications emphasize the theoretical relationship between impairment, disability, and the workplace. This article intended to provide the reader with some framework in this regard, but its main intent is to create a practical how-to-guide in the evaluation of impairment and disability that result from low back pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
